---
import Layout from '../../layouts/CommercialLayout.astro';
---
<Layout lang="en" page="home" title="Charging shaped around your working day" description="Your show begins. Your transport keeps moving. Stroomlijnen aligns charging and energy with your site, your schedule and the people who work there." showClosing={false}>
 <div class="home-story">
  <section class="story-hero shell" aria-labelledby="home-title">
   <div class="story-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Energy for what moves you</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">All eyes<br/>on <em>your moment.</em></h1>
    <p class="story-intro">The doors are opening. The truck needs to leave again later. Stroomlijnen brings charging and energy together, around your working day.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/en/contact/">Discuss your site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="story-scroll" href="#werkdag"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> Discover how it works</a>
   </div>
   <figure class="story-hero-image">
    <img src="/images/itgwo/main-stage-04275-1600.webp" srcset="/images/itgwo/main-stage-04275-480.webp 480w, /images/itgwo/main-stage-04275-960.webp 960w, /images/itgwo/main-stage-04275-1600.webp 1600w, /images/itgwo/main-stage-04275-2400.webp 2400w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1392px) 57vw, 760px" width="6000" height="4000" fetchpriority="high" alt="An audience enjoys a performance on a stage among the trees at Into The Great Wide Open"/>
    <div class="story-photo-note" aria-hidden="true"><span class="story-spark"></span>Behind every moment<br/>there is energy.</div>
    <figcaption><span>Into The Great Wide Open · Vlieland</span><span>Photo: Sabine Haitsma</span></figcaption>
   </figure>
  </section>
  <nav class="story-chapters shell" aria-label="From your working day to a charging plan that fits"><a href="#werkdag">01 / Your working day</a><a href="#energie">02 / Room to charge</a><a href="#praktijk">03 / In practice</a></nav>

  <section id="werkdag" class="story-problem shell story-section" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
   <div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">01 / Your working day</p><h2 id="problem-title">Everything comes together.<br/>On one grid connection.</h2><p class="story-intro">The crew is setting up. The kitchen is busy. Outside, a driver plugs in. Just when everyone needs power, you want a plan you can work with.</p></div>
   <div class="story-day" data-reveal>
    <p class="story-small-label">A familiar show day</p>
    <ol>
     <li data-reveal><time>14:00</time><div><h3>Setting up</h3><p>Lights, sound and kitchen get going.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
     <li data-reveal><time>17:00</time><div><h3>Plugging in</h3><p>The truck is parked. A good time to charge.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
     <li data-reveal><time>19:30</time><div><h3>Doors open</h3><p>The audience needs attention. So does power allocation.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="story-fine">An illustrative working day, not measured data.</p>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section id="energie" class="story-energy" aria-labelledby="energy-title">
   <div class="shell story-section">
    <div class="story-energy-intro" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Room to charge</p><h2 id="energy-title">Your building and chargers.<br/><em>In the same rhythm.</em></h2></div><p>First, we look at what your site uses and when vehicles need to leave. Then we plan charging around that. Your charging plan starts with everyday practice.</p></div>
    <figure class="story-flow" data-reveal>
     <svg class="flow-wide" viewBox="0 0 1000 350" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc">
      <title id="flow-title">Sharing power across your site</title><desc id="flow-desc">A grid connection supplies local power management. It adjusts charging to building demand, within the available capacity.</desc>
      <defs><pattern id="flow-dots" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="#304054"/></pattern></defs>
      <rect width="1000" height="350" fill="url(#flow-dots)"/>
      <g fill="none" stroke="#3d5369" stroke-width="2"><path d="M180 175H400M540 175H625Q650 175 650 150V95H785M650 150V255H785"/></g>
      <g class="energy-traces" fill="none" stroke-width="3"><path d="M180 175H400"/><path d="M540 175H625Q650 175 650 150V95H785"/><path d="M540 175H625Q650 175 650 200V255H785"/></g>
      <g stroke="#e6edf4" stroke-width="2" fill="#0a1628" stroke-linejoin="round">
       <rect x="100" y="133" width="80" height="84" rx="3"/><path d="M124 153V174M155 153V174M124 164H155M140 174V198"/>
       <rect x="400" y="130" width="140" height="90" rx="45" stroke="#00b0e4"/><path d="M441 175H499M452 160V190M487 160V190" stroke="#00b0e4"/><circle cx="452" cy="168" r="5" fill="#00b0e4"/><circle cx="487" cy="183" r="5" fill="#00b0e4"/>
       <path d="M785 119V73L825 54L865 73V119ZM797 119V81H853V119M814 119V94H836V119M807 81V119M843 81V119"/>
       <path d="M785 230H839V271H785ZM839 244H856L872 257V271H839"/><path d="M846 250H854L863 258H846Z"/>
       <circle cx="802" cy="273" r="9"/><circle cx="855" cy="273" r="9"/>
      </g>
      <circle class="charge-signal" cx="871" cy="229" r="5" fill="#84bd00"/>
      <g class="flow-labels" fill="#f2f5f8" text-anchor="middle"><text x="140" y="250">Your connection</text><text x="470" y="253">Smart allocation</text><text x="826" y="151">Your building</text><text x="826" y="313">Your vehicles</text></g>
     </svg>
     <svg class="flow-compact" viewBox="0 0 360 380" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-mobile-title flow-mobile-desc">
      <title id="flow-mobile-title">Sharing power across your site</title><desc id="flow-mobile-desc">A grid connection supplies local power management. It adjusts charging to building demand, within the available capacity.</desc>
      <g fill="none" stroke="#3d5369" stroke-width="2"><path d="M180 74V81M180 112V145M180 205V246H85V285M180 246H275V285"/></g>
      <g class="energy-traces" fill="none" stroke-width="3"><path d="M180 74V81M180 112V145"/><path d="M180 205V246H85V285"/><path d="M180 205V246H275V285"/></g>
      <g fill="#0a1628" stroke="#e6edf4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round">
       <rect x="155" y="20" width="50" height="54" rx="2"/><path d="M170 33V48M190 33V48M170 42H190M180 48V61"/>
       <rect x="115" y="145" width="130" height="60" rx="30" stroke="#00b0e4"/>
       <path d="M65 329V297L85 285L105 297V329ZM73 329V304H97V329M81 329V313H89V329"/>
       <path d="M242 289H281V320H242ZM281 300H295L307 311V320H281"/><circle cx="254" cy="322" r="7"/><circle cx="295" cy="322" r="7"/>
      </g>
      <g fill="#f2f5f8" font-size="13" font-family="Inter,Arial,sans-serif" text-anchor="middle"><text x="180" y="101">Your connection</text><text x="180" y="180">Smart allocation</text><text x="85" y="357">Your building</text><text x="275" y="357">Your vehicles</text></g>
     </svg>
     <figcaption><span>Simply put: available power is shared between your building and chargers.</span><span>Simplified illustration · possibilities vary by site</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="story-steps">
     <li data-reveal><span>01</span><div><h3>Understand first</h3><p>We measure your usage and listen to your schedule.</p></div></li>
     <li data-reveal><span>02</span><div><h3>Then coordinate</h3><p>Charging gets room within the limits of your connection.</p></div></li>
     <li data-reveal><span>03</span><div><h3>Grow where possible</h3><p>More charging power or storage? We assess what fits your site.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section id="praktijk" class="story-proof shell story-section" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
   <div class="story-proof-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / In practice · Into The Great Wide Open</p><h2 id="proof-title">First the tractor.<br/>Then the stage.</h2></div><p class="story-proof-number"><strong>2</strong><span>applications, in one day</span></p></div>
   <div class="story-proof-grid">
    <figure class="story-truck" data-reveal><img src="/images/itgwo/truck-tractor-248-960.webp" srcset="/images/itgwo/truck-tractor-248-480.webp 480w, /images/itgwo/truck-tractor-248-960.webp 960w, /images/itgwo/truck-tractor-248-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), 60vw" width="6000" height="4000" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Electric tractor beside a truck among the trees at Into The Great Wide Open"/><figcaption><span>01 / Sharing power between truck and tractor</span><span>Photo: Sabine Haitsma</span></figcaption></figure>
    <div class="story-proof-copy" data-reveal><p class="story-intro">At Into The Great Wide Open, a truck first shared power with an electric tractor. Later that day, the truck supplied energy to the main stage. One day, two ways to put mobile energy to work.</p><p class="story-fine">This was a practical experiment, not a standard service. Our Stroomlijnen charger was also on the festival grounds.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/about/#fieldwork-title">The story behind the experiment <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <figure class="story-connector" data-reveal><img src="/images/itgwo/connector-157-480.webp" srcset="/images/itgwo/connector-157-480.webp 480w, /images/itgwo/connector-157-960.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 60vw, 25vw" width="4000" height="6000" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="A hand connects the Stroomlijnen charger’s connector on the ITGWO grounds"/><figcaption>Also on site: our Stroomlijnen charger.<br/>Photo: Sabine Haitsma</figcaption></figure>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-applications" aria-labelledby="applications-title">
   <div class="shell story-section">
    <div class="story-app-intro" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">04 / Your site</p><h2 id="applications-title">A different rhythm.<br/>The same question.</h2><p>How can vehicles charge while work carries on? Your schedule is the starting point.</p></div>
    <div class="story-application-list">
     <a href="/en/contact/" data-reveal><span class="story-application-index">01</span><div><h3>Theatres & cultural venues</h3><p>From the first setup to the last truck. A charging plan that takes your show day into account.</p><span class="story-application-link">Tell us about your theatre</span></div><span class="story-application-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
     <a href="/en/applications/#sector-3" data-reveal><span class="story-application-index">02</span><div><h3>Transport & fleets</h3><p>A parked truck has a window to charge. We bring arrival, departure and available power together.</p><span class="story-application-link">Explore the applications</span></div><span class="story-application-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <details class="story-kit" data-reveal><summary>The charger follows your working day <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="story-kit-body"><dl><div><dt>Fixed DC charger</dt><dd><strong>120 kW</strong><p>Expandable to 160 kW with an additional 40 kW module.</p></dd></div><div><dt>AC · longer stays</dt><dd><strong>22 kW</strong></dd></div><div><dt>Mobile DC · on site</dt><dd><strong>30 kW</strong></dd></div></dl><p class="story-fine">Nominal ratings. Actual charging power depends on the vehicle and site.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://docs.stroomlijnen.nl/en/">Explore our documentation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></details>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-contact shell story-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
   <div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">The next step starts with a conversation</p><h2 id="contact-title">What needs to<br/><em>keep moving at your site?</em></h2></div>
   <div class="story-contact-copy" data-reveal><p>Tell us about your site and your working day. You don’t need the technical answers yet.</p><a class="button" href="/en/contact/">Discuss your site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="story-docs"><p>Want the technical details?</p><a class="text-link" href="https://docs.stroomlijnen.nl/en/">Explore our documentation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  </section>
 </div>
</Layout>
<script>
 import '../../scripts/home-story';
</script>
